   "answer": [
    "C"
   ],
   "accept": null,
   "answerText": null,
   "points": null,
   "explanation": "**答案依据**：$E\\left(\\frac{1}{n}\\sum(X_i-Χ¯)^2\\right)=σ^2\\cdot\\frac{n-1}{n}≠σ^2$。分母 $n-1$ 才使 $E(S^2)=σ^2$（无偏）。C 正确。",
   "misconception": null,
